cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VHE-Net, please cite this repository."
title: "VHE-Net: reproducible deep learning for virus-host association ranking"
authors:
  - alias: dupllin
    website: "https://github.com/dupllin"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dupllin/VHE-Net"
keywords:
  - virus-host interaction
  - protein language model
  - link prediction
  - ranking
  - computational biology
abstract: >-
  VHE-Net scores every (virus, host) pair on a fixed 934 x 451 grid and ranks
  candidate hosts per virus. It couples a frozen LucaVirus protein language
  model encoder (0.95 B parameters) with learned interaction heads and a
  niche-weighted training objective.
